    "detailed_description": "Enemies keep coming. You have to use your mouse to <i><u>move</u></i> and <i><u>dash</u></i> to survive as long as you can.<br><br>Make good use of dash boosts, shields, bombs, etc. to help you survive longer.<br><br>Use your items carefully, lure and kill enemies to still have room to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/a08b5e01e164cecb9950547b9fc1af0a.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/a08b5e01e164cecb9950547b9fc1af0a.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/a08b5e01e164cecb9950547b9fc1af0a.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>If you play well, you'll enter the powerful <i><u>Hyper Mode</u></i>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/11ef0d56b1a9c4561cfd8538250d8805.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/11ef0d56b1a9c4561cfd8538250d8805.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/11ef0d56b1a9c4561cfd8538250d8805.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/99bb7879bc3d580caa79c356f2821daf.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/99bb7879bc3d580caa79c356f2821daf.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/99bb7879bc3d580caa79c356f2821daf.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>When touched by an enemy or enemy attack, hyper mode is canceled and life is reduced.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/c3485ad407eb12758965ca307e2db1c5.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/c3485ad407eb12758965ca307e2db1c5.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/c3485ad407eb12758965ca307e2db1c5.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/85a78394758e8d5dc8bf807242a50020.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/85a78394758e8d5dc8bf807242a50020.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/85a78394758e8d5dc8bf807242a50020.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>If you find an opening and move while dashing at the appropriate angle and timing, your chances of survival will increase.<br><br>Survive as long as you can and score high!<br><br><br><br><br>( Currently, the free demo only has an arcade mode.<br>But the game will feature <i><u>more action, combat, and puzzles</u></i>.<br>Please look forward to seeing <i><u>Fruit Of Choice</u></i> develop in the future :D )",
    "about_the_game": "Enemies keep coming. You have to use your mouse to <i><u>move</u></i> and <i><u>dash</u></i> to survive as long as you can.<br><br>Make good use of dash boosts, shields, bombs, etc. to help you survive longer.<br><br>Use your items carefully, lure and kill enemies to still have room to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/a08b5e01e164cecb9950547b9fc1af0a.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/a08b5e01e164cecb9950547b9fc1af0a.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/a08b5e01e164cecb9950547b9fc1af0a.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>If you play well, you'll enter the powerful <i><u>Hyper Mode</u></i>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/11ef0d56b1a9c4561cfd8538250d8805.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/11ef0d56b1a9c4561cfd8538250d8805.webm?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/11ef0d56b1a9c4561cfd8538250d8805.mp4?t=1752128869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras/99bb7879bc3d580caa79c356f2821daf.poster.avif?t=1752128869\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637160/extras